It's spring.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:48.100
I've made up my mind!

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.970
Let's have bamboo shoots for dinner today!

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:02.620
I appreciate all your work thus far, 370.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:09.560
But you can forget about the mission I had asked you to carry out.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.000
Why is that?

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:18.620
It's now clear to me that even with the meager scraps of information data you've sent me,

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:22.900
...merely compiling data won't do me any good.

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:26.390
Well, I suppose I knew that from the very beginning.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.300
I now believe that I have no other option...

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:34.830
...but to acquire the unit herself. Mahoro.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.780
But I...  I can't...

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.790
I understand, I understand.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.960
That's one thing I won't ask of you.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:45.810
You can do something simpler for me. Something simple.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:49.610
In other words, this will be your final mission.

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:52.030
Final...?

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:56.270
So, once I've done this, I'll be able to get what you promised me?

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.860
Hm? Oh, yes, of course.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.460
Um... What was it?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:02.780
A heart.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.880
Please give me a heart.

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.480
Oh! Right, right!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:29.100
Excuse me, Professor, but we really must return 370 soon.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.750
Hm? Yes, yes, of course.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:36.050
All right, 370, let me give you your final orders.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.630
It's a simple thing, really.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:45.920
To facilitate the capture of V1046R-MAHORO, I want you to kidnap Suguru Misato.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.860
Today's going to be a wonderful, sunny, springtime day.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:09.290
It's the perfect weather to hold your closing ceremonies!

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:10.700
You think so?

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.020
I certainly do!

00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:17.950
I'd like you to be prim and proper as befits this glorious day, you two.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:19.480
Sure...

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.210
Is something the matter, Minawa?

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.570
It's nothing.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.290
Hot!

