00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.940
M-Minawa?

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:14.950
I... I won some free movie passes in a lottery.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.480
So, um, I was wondering if you wouldn't mind going with me tomorrow or some other time.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.360
Wh-What do you say?

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:24.150
Tomorrow's no good.

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.240
Oh, you don't like fantasy movies?

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.680
Well, I've got passes for science fiction, love romances, and...

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.560
I've got all kinds!

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:34.880
If tomorrow's no good, how about the day after? Or the day after that?

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.700
Or next year or even the year after that!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.020
The day after tomorrow and the day after that are also no good.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:41.750
I'm sorry.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.280
Huh? You mean...

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:45.910
Uh... Are you...

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:57.830
<b>Minawa Ando</b>

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:57.920
<b>Minawa Ando</b>

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:58.000
<b>Minawa Ando</b>

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:58.120
<b>Minawa Ando</b>

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:58.790
<b>Minawa Ando</b>

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:02.640
Minawa!

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.240
What's the matter? Why the big rush?

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:08.190
I-It's nothing!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.120
We're home!

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:24.840
Looks like Mahoro's stepped out.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:30.630
That's far enough. Get away from Suguru.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.260
Slash?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.370
Cut it out, Slash!

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:49.710
I figured you'd be able to catch that.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:53.730
Who do you think you're mouthing off to, boy?

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:55.700
Slash...

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.730
Minawa?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.180
Don't move.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:03.360
Crap!

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:04.990
I figured as much.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.700
If you can't win by force, win with brains.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.890
Or maybe teamwork, in this case.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:18.290
Guri, don't run so fast, okay?

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.070
Mahoro...

00:07:58.710 --> 00:07:59.440
Sorry...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.200
Slash!

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.710
Slash! Slash!

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.210
It was Management...

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:11.520
They used Minawa to kidnap Suguru...

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:17.860
I'm sorry, Mahoro... I was there with him, but I...

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.240
Don't cry. Don't cry, Mahoro...

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:24.360
Slash...

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.080
I'll be fine with a little sleep.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:30.940
You should be worrying about Suguru and...

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.990
You're right. I'll bring them back.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:35.570
Count on it.

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:40.340
Looks like this is one time I won't be able to stop you...

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:46.770
But it's you that they're really after. Be careful.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:50.140
I know.

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:56.440
Take good care of Slash, Guri.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.570
Look, I keep telling you that I'm fine...

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:03.970
Just go out there and give 'em hell, Mahoro.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:08.280
I can't. If I did that, I'd shorten my life span.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:19.280
Mahoro...

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:23.330
Damn it...

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:37.560
Hey, why would you want to kidnap me?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.770
Good question.

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:46.640
Because you're the son of the previous commander of Vesper, I suppose.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:48.760
My dad was Vesper's WHAT?

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.450
There's got to be some kind of mistake here. My dad was...

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:58.670
I'm told Ryo Misato was quite a capable person.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:04.190
Oh, I bet they never told you! Now it makes sense.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:11.860
Did you think Mahoro's appearance was just a coincidence?

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:14.930
That was a bit foolish, don't you think?

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:21.640
She knew.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:26.450
She knew about your father. And she knew about you.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:32.440
You know, I don't think I'll be able to pass the time with you.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:34.190
W-Wait!

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:43.450
It'll be okay. Mahoro will come rescue us.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.640
Both me AND you, Minawa.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:05.660
Maybe I was too naive.

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:11.060
Maybe it was too much to ask to try to save Minawa.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.300
If anything were to happen to Suguru...

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:20.300
No, I'll never let that happen. Never!

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.280
Is this really such a good idea?

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:24.940
Huh? What do you mean?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.820
We'll be going up against that special android.

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:34.570
Oh, you think I've slipped up, do you?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.330
It's just that there's no precedent for direct confrontation.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.310
It's not that there's no chance of success, but...

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.790
You don't feel anything, do you?

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.800
If this goes off as planned,

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:51.340
...I'll get my hands on that machine that even Vesper says is the most powerful of all!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:57.140
This "Mahoro" is my ideal given form!

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:02.310
This is my chance to finally get my hands on something...

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:05.630
...that I've only seen in footage or in data so far!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:09.690
Do you think a little danger will frighten me off?!

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:10.290
No, sir.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.840
Admiration. Envy. Jealousy.

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:15.780
This might be a problem.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:19.560
Professor, this is a bit dangerous.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:21.050
It's a little late for that now!

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.890
Let's get out of here, Minawa!

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:29.780
If we stay here as hostages, it'll put Mahoro in danger.

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:35.010
What are you saying? I'm here to keep an eye on you.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:40.400
Oh, cut that out! I know you don't want to do this, right, Minawa?

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:46.380
Do you really want to hand over Mahoro to those people?!

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:54.740
My... My objective from the very beginning was to observe big sister and report on her.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.650
I'm begging you, Minawa...

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:01.670
Don't put Mahoro in any more danger than she's already in.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:07.110
I can't. I have a promise to keep.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.110
Why...?

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:18.490
This is...

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:24.560
Oh, you can relax. This facility has been abandoned for decades.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.190
It's a bit like a graveyard.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:48.180
Minawa!

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:52.210
Please don't move. Put down your gun.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:54.060
Don't do this, Minawa!

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:57.310
Mahoro would never shoot us!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.910
No, be careful, 370.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.320
She'll shoot if she sees an opening.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:10.080
She used to be Vesper's most powerful warrior, after all.

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:14.270
At that range, she could shoot just you.

00:14:18.010 --> 00:14:21.000
Put that thing down, Minawa.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.940
Those shouldn't be pointed at people.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:27.470
I can't. This is my mission.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:34.200
They'll get you, a Vesper android, and I'll get my heart.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:39.460
I'll laugh more and be happier and see beautiful things!

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:43.530
Because that's what I promised 369.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:49.580
Don't let her spot you.

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:52.010
Yes, Professor. I'm on it.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:56.400
Was this "369" person a friend of yours?

00:14:57.030 --> 00:14:58.520
I don't really know.

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:02.830
But I was with 369 ever since the day I was born.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.620
But she was precious to me!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:10.310
That's why I have to keep this promise, no matter what!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:14.560
Now!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.150
Mahoro!

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.910
A girl with no heart would never cry!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:36.660
This is... a heart? This is my heart?

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:40.140
No... I hate this...

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:43.480
How can a heart be something that hurts this much?

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:47.530
This isn't what we wanted!

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.030
Help me, 369...

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:57.760
What do you think you're doing?!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:15:59.960
Would you mind letting go?

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:03.240
Suguru!

00:16:05.070 --> 00:16:09.000
We're fighting a special android that's practically a monster.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:11.530
We have to completely incapacitate it.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:22.080
I was told that damage up to and including ego collapse is fine.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:26.630
The Professor doesn't care for the idea of machines having hearts, you see.

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:31.140
Big sister's heart...

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:35.860
You're no longer of any use to us, so feel free to do whatever you like.

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.010
Come with me!

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:51.830
Think back, Minawa! It can't have been all bad!

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:54.340
There must have been happy times, too!

00:16:54.930 --> 00:16:57.120
Remember how you felt then!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:03.020
Even with me, I'll never forget how much it hurt when Mom and Dad died!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:08.930
But now I have lots of memories with Mahoro and you and the guys!

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:12.910
And it's because I have those that I can make it through the tough times!

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:14.340
I...

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:17.760
You have to stay away!

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:20.650
They're only after me!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:24.020
Don't talk like that, Mahoro! Don't give up!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.440
Suguru, you have to stay away!

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:34.930
One more time. This time, raise their output to maximum level.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:36.430
Are you sure?

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:39.520
Anything higher will damage her body.

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:42.220
Don't you understand?

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.540
It's right there!

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:48.900
I'm on the verge of getting that beautiful machine!

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:52.540
It's too dangerous, Suguru! Stay away!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:57.200
I can't live without you! Mahoro!

00:17:57.780 --> 00:18:00.690
It's enough to know that's how you feel!

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:03.330
That's why I don't want to...

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:07.120
Mahoro, you're precious to me!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.220
No, that's not what I mean!

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:13.430
I don't deserve it!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.430
I...  I...

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:28.170
I'm the one who let your father, Commander Misato, die!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:37.460
I'm the one who took away the most important person in the world to you!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.200
Suguru, grab on.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:51.120
I...

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:56.340
I love my big sister.

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:01.050
I love the days I spent with her and everyone else.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:14.890
Hit!

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.350
She hit them? 370 hit them?!

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:24.720
Mahoro!

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:27.070
Suguru...

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:28.750
Minawa...

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:32.410
369, something tells me that I found...

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:37.950
Minawa!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.070
Minawa!

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:41.510
Big... sister...

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:43.760
Huh?

